# api http test requests for VSCode rest client

### get cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### get cat by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/5

### post new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Cat",
  "birthdate": "2021-09-01",
  "weight": 5,
  "owner": "Jaakko Saukko",
  "image": "https://loremflickr.com/320/240/cat"
}

### post new cat with image
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Misu
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

6
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="owner"

3602
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2023-10-08
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dog.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dog.jpg
--MyBoundary--



### get users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### get user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/3

### post new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outo",
  "username": "outo",
  "email": "outo@gmail.com",
  "role": "User",
  "password": "###########"
}